hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22685","Khalaf ibn al-Walid narrated to us, Khalid narrated to us, from Sa'id al-Jurayri, from al-Sa'di, from his father or his uncle, who said: I observed the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, in his prayer, and he would remain in his bowing and prostration about as long as one says Glory be to Allah and with His praise three times."
